OL,3,GNEWSAFuel costs squeezing margins for
OL,4,Asome businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome businesses in Jersey have
OL,7,Fexpressed concern about the impact of
OL,8,Frising global fuel prices.
OL,10,FLocally, and in the UK, diesel prices
OL,11,Frecently topped #2 a litre, and global
OL,12,Fleaders have since made efforts to ease
OL,13,Fthe strain on supply.
OL,15,FThe Government of Jersey has proposed
OL,16,Fto freeze fuel duty in 2027 in a bid to
OL,17,F"help ease cost-of-living pressures".
OL,19,FA&A Scaffolding Solutions said it
OL,20,Fwelcomed that move, but said it would
OL,21,Fprovide "limited relief if global
OL,22,Fprices continue to rise".
